{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43974","headline":"铜雀台怨 · 程长文","name":"铜雀台怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王去後行人绝，箫筝不响歌喉咽。\n雄劒无威光彩沈，宝琴零落金星灭。\n玉阶寂寞坠秋露，月照当时歌舞处。\n当时歌舞人不回，化爲今日西陵灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程长文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}